st.testGetSystemSettingsJson_AllKeys\nfailing: keyLastSuccessfulLatestAnalyticsPartitionUpdate.EVENT (and its\nseven siblings) were reported missing from GET /systemSettings even\nthough the flat key genuinely exists in the response.\n\nRoot cause: JsonObject.get(path) treats \".\" as a path separator, so a\nflat key containing a literal \".\" is read as a nested lookup and\nreports not-found instead of the real value. Any consumer using a\ndot-path-style JSON accessor against these keys would hit the same\nsilent miss.\n\nSwitch the per-type key suffix from \".TYPE_NAME\" to the same PascalCase\nsuffix already used for the getter method names (e.g.\nkeyLastSuccessfulLatestAnalyticsPartitionUpdateEvent instead of\n...Update.EVENT) — no separator character, consistent with every other\ncompound settings key in this codebase, and immune to dot-path\nambiguity. Added a regression-guard test asserting none of the\nper-type keys contain \".\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"8bc60841a810e5ae8283f69618c4e63502c5876a","tree_id":"e22b0e3a6e056acca26359e54f75f190004fb1a5","timestamp":"2026-08-18T14:54:10Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/g